};

type ProgramQualityEvaluation = {
  passed: boolean;
  hardFailures: ProgramQualityFinding[];
  warnings: ProgramQualityFinding[];
  capabilityLimitations: ProgramQualityFinding[];
  deferredContent: ProgramQualityFinding[];

  structuralScore?: number;
  coachingComplete: boolean;
  deterministicSignature?: string;
};
```

Do not force this exact shape if equivalent types already exist.

Required principles:

* hard failures are structurally invalid outcomes;
* warnings are valid outcomes that deserve internal visibility;
* capability limitations describe what confirmed equipment physically cannot provide;
* deferred content covers intentionally postponed items such as planned videos;
* a capability limitation must never satisfy a missing structural role falsely;
* planned videos are not Phase 7 failures;
* raw internal reason codes must not be exposed directly to users.

